&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4714&quot; data-local-id=&quot;45ac9d4a7dd1&quot;&gt;Forecast accurately and manage pipeline health across segments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
