&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Global Automation and Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee the lifecycle of custom security automation frameworks, API integrations, and developer-focused tooling to eliminate operational overhead and accelerate global incident response velocities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Harden Infrastructure and Platform Security:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with global Cloud and Infrastructure teams to seamlessly embed modern security controls, baseline configurations, and policy-as-code directly into CI/CD pipelines and Linux-based infrastructure workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advance Detection Engineering Fidelity:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate closely with Security Operations to transform high-level telemetry, logging strategies, and log analysis into high-fidelity detection logic and automated response playbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion Cross-Functional Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate complex architectural strategies into practical, measurable execution roadmaps, leading through influence to optimize and consolidate Everpure&#39;s global security tooling ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
