&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Engineering Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to manage, inspire, and scale technical teams while institutionalizing software engineering principles like rigorous code quality, continuous testing, and automation-first development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Product Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience driving complex, multi-organizational product features and security initiatives from inception to global deployment by successfully influencing distributed, cross-functional engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Security &amp;amp; Infrastructure Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced engineering capability navigating platform security across enterprise Linux environments, public/hybrid cloud architectures, container orchestration (such as Kubernetes), and full-stack defense layers (SIEM, EDR, and vulnerability management).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architectural Fluency &amp;amp; Business Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional technical depth required to lead complex design reviews and earn the trust of principal engineers, paired with the commercial mindset needed to articulate security risk trade-offs clearly to business executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systemic Analytical Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Masterful ability to deconstruct ambiguous assignments, design resilient multi-tenant integrations, and spearhead foundational processes that structurally elevate global corporate resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
