&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1ao976g&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;62&quot;&gt;Clinical Manager (RN or Physical Therapist) – Home Health&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;63&quot; data-end=&quot;324&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; is seeking a Clinical Manager (RN or Physical Therapist) to join our Exton, PA Senior Living office. This office provides high-quality home health services to senior clients throughout Exton and the surrounding communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;326&quot; data-end=&quot;705&quot;&gt;If you are looking for the next step in your clinical leadership career, this is an exciting opportunity to join a mission-driven organization dedicated to delivering care with compassion, excellence, and reliability. As a Clinical Manager, you will play a key role in supporting clinical excellence, mentoring field staff, and ensuring exceptional care delivery for our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;103byja&quot; data-start=&quot;707&quot; data-end=&quot;728&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;729&quot; data-end=&quot;1336&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1oahngp&quot; data-start=&quot;729&quot; data-end=&quot;811&quot;&gt;Lead, inspire, and motivate clinical staff to provide outstanding patient care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;165awfo&quot; data-start=&quot;812&quot; data-end=&quot;904&quot;&gt;Conduct client assessments and supervisory visits throughout Exton and surrounding areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19rvi6c&quot; data-start=&quot;905&quot; data-end=&quot;981&quot;&gt;Develop individualized care plans and oversee implementation of services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19xwt6a&quot; data-start=&quot;982&quot; data-end=&quot;1055&quot;&gt;Supervise and support RNs, PTs, OTs, SLPs, and other field clinicians&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i7mpyg&quot; data-start=&quot;1056&quot; data-end=&quot;1106&quot;&gt;Facilitate new hire orientation and onboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;yu6b2y&quot; data-start=&quot;1107&quot; data-end=&quot;1172&quot;&gt;Conduct competency evaluations for both new and tenured staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5b8sdp&quot; data-start=&quot;1173&quot; data-end=&quot;1245&quot;&gt;Review and monitor clinical documentation within Home Care Home Base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bumxkl&quot; data-start=&quot;1246&quot; data-end=&quot;1336&quot;&gt;Ensure compliance with company policies, regulatory standards, and quality initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1obkcim&quot; data-start=&quot;1338&quot; data-end=&quot;1357&quot;&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1358&quot; data-end=&quot;1738&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;fjrhvp&quot; data-start=&quot;1358&quot; data-end=&quot;1434&quot;&gt;Active Registered Nurse (RN) or Physical Therapist (PT) license required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;11s2u5k&quot; data-start=&quot;1435&quot; data-end=&quot;1489&quot;&gt;Minimum of 2 years of clinical experience required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;k89njg&quot; data-start=&quot;1490&quot; data-end=&quot;1525&quot;&gt;Home Health experience required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vqpew8&quot; data-start=&quot;1526&quot; data-end=&quot;1582&quot;&gt;Prior supervisory or leadership experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cuh60b&quot; data-start=&quot;1583&quot; data-end=&quot;1644&quot;&gt;Strong clinical, communication, and organizational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;156l89r&quot; data-start=&quot;1645&quot; data-end=&quot;1738&quot;&gt;Ability to build strong relationships with clients, families, and interdisciplinary teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
