&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: #cc092f;&quot;&gt;Now Hiring: Registered Nurses (RNs) in Minnesota&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Join a team that puts care, and caregivers, first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;BAYADA is hiring skilled and reliable RNs to care for clients in Maple Grove and nearby communities. You’ll build real connections through 1:1 home care while enjoying flexible hours, consistent pay, and the professional support you deserve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: #cc092f;&quot;&gt;What BAYADA Offers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;$35–41/hour in Minnesota (including overnight and weekend shift differentials)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-time, part-time, and PRN (minimum two shifts/month)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daytime and Overnight Shifts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8-hour, 10-hour, or 12-hour shifts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No Weekend Requirement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: #cc092f;&quot;&gt;Why Nurses Choose BAYADA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
